  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 1
  storyText: "We used to joke about the apocalypse. We're not laughing anymore. The
    canteen was boringly normal at first \u2014 people eating, ducks hunting crumbs
    like little dinosaurs. Then we went into the mini-mart. Five minutes later, screaming.
    We looked through the glass and saw someone getting chased. Thought it was a
    fight. Then the red sprayed. Yeah, not a fight. The bitten got back up. Of course
    they did. The mini-mart went insane. We ran to the 5th floor. Made it. Campus
    is chaos now. Screams everywhere. Worse than the movies. We still have a class
    today, though. Guess we're skipping. The ducks? No idea. They probably ran faster
    than us."
